            <div xml:id="d55">

                <pb facs="0139" n="53" sameAs="frus:frus1927v01/pg53"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15 a 1/316: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-06-24T19:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 24, 1927—7
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>10. Your No. 25, June 23, 7 p.m. The action which you suggest taking is in accord
                    with your instructions. I approve your supporting adoption of decision by
                    Conference along lines set forth.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
